The DINOv3 towers are instantiated from transformers' built-in
DINOv3ViTModel (Apache-2.0); no DINOv3 model code is bundled here.
Decoder blocks build on timm layers (Apache-2.0).

Weights notice: the released PaGE checkpoints bundle DINOv3-derivative
tower weights. Those weights remain governed by Meta's DINOv3 License
Agreement (commercial use permitted; redistribution must include the
license text). Every LibreYOLO/LibrePAGE* Hugging Face repo therefore
ships DINOv3_LICENSE.md alongside the weights, and the weights cannot be
relicensed as plain MIT.
